From: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 07:28:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ffmpeg: remove obsolete OpenGL configure switch

Current FFmpeg rejects --enable-opengl. Remove only the obsolete FFmpeg
configure argument; leave mpv rendering, GPL and hardware options intact.

diff --git a/packages/ffmpeg.cmake b/packages/ffmpeg.cmake
--- a/packages/ffmpeg.cmake
+++ b/packages/ffmpeg.cmake
@@ -105,7 +105,6 @@ ExternalProject_Add(ffmpeg
         --enable-nvenc
         --enable-amf
         --enable-openal
-        --enable-opengl
         --disable-doc
         --disable-ffplay
         --disable-ffprobe
